                                                "sense_id": "5db49e20-389d-3477-a669-be95abfd7ac9",
                                                "text": "While they worked together, [Frank] Marks quickly learned that when [Peter] Dodge offered his thoughts in an email and wrote “IMHO,” meaning “in my humble opinion,” Marks should heed them because “that meant I was screwing up,” he said."
